  "title": "Asian Beef Skewers",
  "description": "Strips of flank steak are marinated overnight in a very flavorful mixture of hoisin sauce, soy sauce, ginger, sherry, barbeque sauce, green onions and garlic. Skewer, grill and serve as an entree or appetizer.",
  "authors": [
